improve the blur edging  and avoid random mistakes now another  thing that ben bengeskin on twitter  noticed about greg's tweet is that  within the short clip you can notice a  little sunset in the corner of the frame  which could be pointing to a new bronze  or sunset gold iphone color option which  is something that is also rumored to be  coming with the iphone 13 lineup and  interestingly the twitter hash flag that  apple chose for the apple event hashtag  is basically a sunset at twilight  further pointing to the new color option  and now moving on to the final detail  that i found that gives us a hint at one  of the biggest features we should expect  on the iphone 13 pro  is the actual source image that apple  used for the invitation a twitter user  helped me find the source image by  accessing the website source code and it  looks like this an incredible landscape  scene of this beautiful tree line that  fades to black on the sides  interestingly the aspect ratio of this  image is reminiscent of the ultra  panavision 70 millimeter film aspect  ratio which classic films like ben hur  were filmed in as well as the quentin  taratino flick the hateful eight so as  you can tell this new invitation has me  extremely excited for the event next  week where we should expect a bunch of  new product reveals like the iphone 13  lineup the apple watch series 7 the  airpods 3 the ipad 9 and the ipad mini  6. now if you want to know every  specific detail about what to expect  from each of those products definitely  watch my full september event leaks  video after this one is over but right  now i want to finish off with a couple  of brand new leaks that just came out a  new mac slave charger for the iphone 13  just popped up in fcc filings ahead of  launch which could go hand in hand with  the rumors of apple using a larger  wireless charging coil for the iphone 13  lineup to allow for better heat  management moving on according to shrimp  alpha pro both of the iphone 13 pro  models will support low earth orbit  satellite connectivity in the united  states using elon musk's starlink  satellite internet system but for now  it'll likely only be used for emergency  calls and messages for areas where you  have no cellular signal pine leaks also  gave us some more details where they  don't expect a price hike for the iphone  13 lineup which is great news they also  believe that the optical image  stabilization system will be less  aggressive and more smooth compared to  previous models which will help with the  new portrait cinematic video mode which  they believe will use a new warp system  which will attempt to keep a subject  close to the center of the frame they  also claim that the airpods 3 charging  case will have a 20 larger battery  compared to the second gen and it's  gonna have wireless charging included  they also said the overall sound quality  will stay the same but will be getting  an improvement on the base and low end  frequencies the batteries on the airpods  3 earbuds themselves will be around the  same size as the current airpods pro  which is actually around 72 percent  larger than the battery cell in each  airpods 2 earbud which is a very good  sign for battery life and finally pine  leaks claim that the apple watch series  7 should give us our first real battery  life improvement since the original  apple watch and by the way mark german  claimed that the series 7 will be  available in limited quantities at  launch so if you want to get one  definitely pre-order it as soon as it  becomes available or you could end up  waiting weeks to get one so there you  guys have it hopefully you enjoyed my  analysis of the apple event invitation  and if you did go ahead and click the  circle above to subscribe for more  videos like this one and definitely  watch the full september event leaks  video right over there thanks for  watching and we'll see you in the next  video  [Music]
 

